OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle fire on M25 leads to
OL,4,Atraffic tailbacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car fire on the M25 in Surrey on
OL,7,FMonday morning has caused six-mile
OL,8,Ftraffic queues into the afternoon.
OL,10,FThe incident took place between
OL,11,Fjunctions J10 (Cobham) and J11
OL,12,F(Chertsey), and has led to long delays
OL,13,Fof nearly 45 minutes on the approach,
OL,14,Faccording to Highways England.
OL,16,FSurrey Fire and Rescue Service (SFRS)
OL,17,Fsaid it was alerted at 10:50 BST and
OL,18,Fsent three fire engines to the scene.
OL,20,FHighways England said all lanes have
OL,21,Fsince reopened, but warned of
OL,22,Fcongestion.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
